\b\fs32 System Architecture\b0\fs28\par
The system architecture of the project is designed as a modular and sequential pipeline that automates the analysis of test execution logs and provides actionable insights using machine learning and rule-based techniques. The architecture transforms raw, unstructured logs into structured outputs such as test status, root cause, and recommendations.\par
\b 1. Log Input Layer\b0\par

\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\ri-924\sa200\sl360\slmult1\qj Accepts raw test execution log files generated from automated testing systems.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab} Supports multiple test runs and large log volumes.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Acts as the entry point for the analysis pipeline.\par

\pard\ri-924\sa200\sl360\slmult1\qj\b 2. Log Extraction Module (`extract_logs`)\par

\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\ri-924\sa200\sl360\slmult1\qj\b0 Extracts log files from compressed archives or directories.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Organizes logs based on execution metadata such as date and test configuration.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Ensures availability of raw logs for processing.\par

\pard\ri-924\sa200\sl360\slmult1\qj\b 3. Log Conversion Module (`convert_to_csv`)\par

\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\ri-924\sa200\sl360\slmult1\qj\b0 Converts raw log files into structured CSV format.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Extracts essential fields such as timestamps, test case names, execution status, and log messages.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Enables efficient storage and downstream processing.\par

\pard\ri-924\sa200\sl360\slmult1\qj\b 4. Log Preprocessing Module (`preprocess_logs`)\b0\par

\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\ri-924\sa200\sl360\slmult1\qj Cleans and filters log data by removing noise and irrelevant entries.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Handles missing values and extracts meaningful error-related messages.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Prepares both textual and numerical data for feature generation.\par

\pard\ri-924\sa200\sl360\slmult1\qj\b 5. Feature Engineering Module (`feature_engineering`)\b0\par

\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\ri-924\sa200\sl360\slmult1\qj Generates relevant features from preprocessed logs.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Includes statistical features, time-based features, and text-based representations.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Produces model-ready inputs for clustering and classification tasks.\par

\pard\ri-924\sa200\sl360\slmult1\qj\b 6. Failure Clustering Module (`failure_clustering`)\b0\par

\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\ri-924\sa200\sl360\slmult1\qj Groups failed test cases based on similarity in log error patterns.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Uses natural language processing and clustering techniques to identify recurring failures.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Helps uncover common functional issues across test runs.\par

\pard\ri-924\sa200\sl360\slmult1\qj\b 7. Abort Clustering Module (`abort_clustering`)\b0\par

\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\ri-924\sa200\sl360\slmult1\qj Analyzes aborted test cases separately due to their distinct nature.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Identifies clusters related to environment, setup, or configuration issues.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab} Improves interpretability and accuracy for abort scenarios.\par

\pard\ri-924\sa200\sl360\slmult1\qj\b 8. Cluster Merging Module\b0\par

\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\ri-924\sa200\sl360\slmult1\qj Merges failure and abort clusters into a unified clustering structure.\par
