{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Ensures consistent data transformation during runtime predictions.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Maintains model reliability and reproducibility.\par

\pard\ri-924\sa200\sl360\slmult1\qj\b\f0\lang16393 13. \f1\lang9 Failure Root\f0\lang16393  C\f1\lang9 ause Model (`train_rootcause_fail_model`)\par

\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\ri-924\sa200\sl360\slmult1\qj\b0 Trains a dedicated machine learning model to predict root causes for failed test cases.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Uses NLP-based features extracted from failure logs.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Improves diagnostic accuracy for functional failures.\par

\pard\ri-924\sa200\sl360\slmult1\qj\b 14. Abort Root Cause Model (`train_rootcause_abort_model`)\b0\par

\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\ri-924\sa200\sl360\slmult1\qj Trains a separate model to predict root causes for aborted test cases.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Focuses on environment, setup, and configuration-related issues.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Enhances clarity in abort analysis.\par

\pard\ri-924\sa200\sl360\slmult1\qj\b\f0\lang16393 15. \f1\lang9 Inference Engine with Recommendation Generation\par

\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\ri-924\sa200\sl360\slmult1\qj\b0 Applies frozen preprocessing and trained models to new log files.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Determines test execution status.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Predicts root causes for FAIL and ABORT cases using respective ML models.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Generates actionable recommendations using rule-based root cause-to-recommendation mapping.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Handles special cases such as user-initiated aborts.\par

\pard\ri-924\sa200\sl360\slmult1\qj\b 1\f0\lang16393 6\f1\lang9 . Output & Reporting Module\par

\pard{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf2\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\ri-924\sa200\sl360\slmult1\qj\b0 Generates structured outputs displaying:\line  Test status\line  Root cause\line\f0\lang16393  \f1\lang9 Recommended action\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Outputs results in console and CSV formats.\par
{\pntext\f2\'B7\tab}Supports integration with automation pipelines and reporting tools.\par

